 "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RJ4CTmh_lnsQ7kNvwH92VaX&_nc_oc=Adqrdewz7wJRLX3xLQ2wNrBbtk5UOjYbtLylGJB6-p6lvDkpLETsiwtigX9pU3trOS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH3rL3Z0oh7CdsheMfwuLFfd9xlktUAY5dFKpx42BU4cg&oe=6A8EC926"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VemnkiexRZAQ7kNvwFoAFed&_nc_oc=AdokGpcY7wGcC5N2uoUM6sCKOcJPtVikwokKDlSja9nAZvU5OQ_Nj4ft4hKRInXmWko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHDEtxtSg4TnhrzqUYt8i3HwqemNZdfIykoju5ZlbpmrA&oe=6A8EBE72"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i6c1p9Er8ngQ7kNvwFeMJQA&_nc_oc=AdoXZGZezFrs45_6ImC2X_mqfffLfLlI0tiUrKQ37MSExp9Ic5dFIL43Kd-x__Ck5A0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG_O-d1gZgKvNbqVUapR0UnpnCWrV14Rbx6DTV2mwIHFg&oe=6A8EF07B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GqW1np3k-iMQ7kNvwF91mnL&_nc_oc=Adr51HA2GHOXnMlEovfNpTwpl2WaEXimbCrxE6XAOzNuGCWEyeNFHmxkQMI0WSLkpQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGvuYmAt9XbuNUz-SFPmvyReq-Gb9q8zsuFprpyk8QmZQ&oe=6A8ECDB3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AT5KqgFOdS0Q7kNvwG-BHM1&_nc_oc=AdrDw-uvbca27GoSVf2MB7HaTDcEMEJ_McfkcdCHwRERuq9YHxIX4yFodyxPObILoO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHXLy3TEFt4tMqRpoVtP8Hf37zGf6u2V2eTZu_hbRWsBA&oe=6A8ECBB2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OjPON14CnA8Q7kNvwHSbdQ8&_nc_oc=Adqijc5J2kgdTDvFRBHcolEEgC17od2rWUFxbu65T0AyTxxFafQdPmgSerIco1Gg0v4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEHOg7yCODXD_oKvNUMVxvG2ds4bfOMf4ElGL31aZ1Bqw&oe=6A8EC313"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8vR2hP_tibgQ7kNvwEKfeUv&_nc_oc=AdoNoZps-1MDNZQYixqhrNuPmK8RPGXf5MwKtI6LFzSGUAUqiqg9LpfuqK5GPSsexMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGY-UmiSfFepbCUGh4L9FdHkMvRRyo7NhGdzBBis65ntQ&oe=6A8EBF2F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ouzgnxWan1kQ7kNvwEF6Fk8&_nc_oc=AdoBR6DiGDdEMRminDMGwec3ZIQtGqtbIv3IPYweUgODIhEYlxfNJ0WC2CbVV8jKmy0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF92BlAmYWTyV6Qm_R4G4qOSSHSELuNaqyBUom6-4AFaw&oe=6A8ECAE2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_97